# GitHub shows "Cite this repository" from this file, and Zenodo reads it for
# the DOI it gives each GitHub release. No version or date: those come from
# the release itself, so this file does not change at each release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use trazo in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: trazo
abstract: >-
  Write scientific papers in Markdown with an AI agent and get a Word
  document ready for coauthors or a journal. Plugin for the Claude and
  ChatGPT desktop apps.
authors:
  - given-names: Jose
    family-names: Lozano Montoya
repository-code: https://github.com/joselznom/trazo
license: MIT
keywords:
  - scientific writing
  - academic writing
  - markdown
  - pandoc
  - docx
  - ai agents
